# 256-Line Cap Boundary Index — oodac
File: oodac/docs/CAP_BOUNDARY.oot

Purpose: list product `.oo` files at the 256-line cliff in this repo.

Method: `find lex ast check types emit cli qa -name '*.oo' | xargs wc -l`

## Cap state

Over-cap (>256): 0 product `.oo` files.
The host script `bootstrap/oodac_pure_build` is the RULES 1.14 exception.

## Split heuristic

When a file reaches 256 lines, split on a domain seam before the next feature.
Do not grow `emit/c/c_emit_lower.oo` or `emit/c/c_emit_match_stmt.oo` in place.
Sealed cap calls live in `c_emit_cap_call.oo`. Match kinds live in `c_emit_match_kind.oo`.
